.TH "Atktopbm User Manual" 0 "26 September 1991" "netpbm documentation"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
atktopbm \- convert Andrew Toolkit raster object to PBM

.UN synopsis
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"

\fBatktopbm\fP [\fIatkfile\fP]

.UN description
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This program is part of
.BR "Netpbm" (1)\c
\&.
.PP
\fBatktopbm\fP reads an Andrew Toolkit raster object as input and produces
a PBM image as output.

.UN options
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
There are no command line options defined specifically for \fBatktopbm\fP,
but it recognizes the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm.
(See 
.UR index.html#commonoptions
 Common Options
.UE
\&).

.UN seealso
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"


.IP \(bu

.BR "pbmtoatk" (1)\c
\&
.IP \(bu

.BR "pbm" (1)\c
\&



